# Vendored third-party snapshot — preserve bytes exactly as imported.
#
# The platform repo runs with core.autocrlf=true. Without this, git would
# rewrite LF to CRLF in every text file here, which breaks the 44 Git-LFS
# pointer stubs under data/processed/ and python_training/models/: the LFS
# spec requires LF line endings, so a CRLF-mangled pointer can never be
# resolved by `git lfs pull` against upstream.
#
# Note this deliberately does NOT re-enable the LFS filters from upstream's
# own .gitattributes (*.npy/*.parquet/*.onnx/*.pkl/*.pth/*.pdf filter=lfs).
# This repo has no LFS configured, and turning the filters on would make
# checkout fail for anyone without git-lfs installed.
* -text
